{"actor":"harvest/zenodo","event_type":"scraped","identity_key":"10.5281/zenodo.4710168","local":{},"observed_at":"2026-09-01T23:20:27Z","provenance":{"authors":{"extraction_method":"api"},"doi":{"extraction_method":"api"},"iea_task":{"extraction_method":"pattern"},"license_id":{"extraction_method":"pattern"},"notes":{"extraction_method":"api"},"resource_kind":{"extraction_method":"api"},"title":{"extraction_method":"api"}},"source":{"access_status":"open","authors":[{"affiliation":"brightwind","name":"stephenholleran"},{"affiliation":"Deutsche WindGuard Wind Tunnel Services GmbH","name":"heikowestermann"},{"name":"Florian Roscheck"},{"affiliation":"@actions","name":"actions-user"},{"name":"Gibson"},{"affiliation":"https://www.res-group.com/digital-solutions/","name":"Jason Fields"},{"affiliation":"KUDO","name":"Christian Jonsson"},{"affiliation":"Altosphere","name":"abohara"},{"name":"MatteoManaRWE"},{"name":"Guillermo Tornero"},{"name":"Michael Purdue"},{"name":"NikoSimisiroglou"},{"affiliation":"@octue","name":"Tom Clark"},{"affiliation":"NRG Systems, Inc","name":"David Carlson"},{"name":"Joseph Lee"}],"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.4710168","extra":{"zenodo_code_repository":"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard","zenodo_concept_recid":"4710168","zenodo_record_id":15677886,"zenodo_version_doi":"10.5281/zenodo.15677886"},"iea_task":["task-43"],"keywords":[],"license_id":"bsd-3-clause","license_raw":"bsd-3-clause","notes":"<p>Below is an extract form the CHANGELOG file showing all the updates for this release.</p>\n<p>The major addition to this version is the development of the Floating Lidar File format. This is version 1.0.0-2025.06 and will follow its own independent versioning. Other changes in this release are to expand the data model to include more floating lidar and metocean measurements, sensors and units.</p>\n<p>The Digital Calibration Certificate had a few units added and is now on version 1.2.0-2025.06.</p>\n[1.4.0-2025.06]\n<ol>\n<li>Introduce the first release of the <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/tree/master/floating_lidar_file_format\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Floating Lidar File Format</a> developed based on discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>.</li>\n<li>To <code>lidar_config</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>logger_stated_device_datum_plane_height_m</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/254\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#254</a>)</li>\n<li><code>logger_stated_device_orientation_deg</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/254\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#254</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>To <code>calibration</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>slope_unit</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a>)</li>\n<li><code>offset_unit</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a>)</li>\n<li><code>sensitivity_unit</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>As a result of Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/248\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#248</a> above, <code>measurement_units</code> are now a definition.</li>\n<li>To <code>measurement_units</code> enum add:<ol>\n<li><code>mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>(m/s)/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>mbar/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>mbar/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>hPa/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>hPa/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>deg_C/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>deg_C/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>%/V</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>%/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>m^2/Hz</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>m^2_s</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13382090\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>Pa</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/279\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#279</a>)</li>\n<li><code>ppm</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>ug/L</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>ntu</code>, <code>fnu</code> and <code>ftu</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>To <code>sensor_type</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>calc</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-11257819\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>fuel_gauge</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-11257819\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>microwave_temperature_profiler</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>nephelometer</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_buoy</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12716402\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>transmissometer</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>fluorometer</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>gps_motion_unit</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>To <code>measurement_type</code> add:<ol>\n<li><code>fuel_level</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-11257819\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>pitch</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>roll</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>heading</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>turbidity</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>visibility_in_air</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-12266281\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_energy_spectrum</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_energy_spectrum_maximum</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_period_first_frequency</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_period_second_frequency</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>wave_period_zero_crossing</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13236974\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n<li><code>mass_concentration</code> (Discussion <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/discussions/268#discussioncomment-13450779\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#268</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>Bug fixes:<ol>\n<li>Add <code>null</code> to <code>license</code> type as it is optional (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/269\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#269</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\nFloating Lidar File Format [1.0.0-2025.06]\n<ol>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ol>\nDigital Calibration Certificate [1.2.0-2025.06]\n<ol>\n<li>To <code>unit</code> enum add:<ol>\n<li><code>mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n<li><code>(m/s)/mV</code> (Issue <a href=\"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/issues/260\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">#260</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>","published_date":"2025-06-16","publisher":"Zenodo","related_identifiers":[{"identifier":"10.5281/zenodo.4710168","identifier_type":"DOI","relation":"IsVersionOf"},{"identifier":"https://github.com/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard/tree/v1.4.0-2025.06","identifier_type":"URL","relation":"isSupplementTo"}],"resource_kind":"software","resources":[{"format":"zip","name":"IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard-v1.4.0-2025.06.zip","url":"https://zenodo.org/records/15677886/files/IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard-v1.4.0-2025.06.zip"}],"source_urls":["https://zenodo.org/records/15677886"],"title":"IEA-Task-43/digital_wra_data_standard: 1.4.0-2025.06","url":"https://zenodo.org/records/15677886","version":"v1.4.0-2025.06","withdrawn":false},"source_id":"15677886","source_key":"4@10.5281/zenodo.15677886","source_system":"zenodo"}
